hadiths[27]{hadithnumber,text}:
"47","Kulayb ibn Manfa'a reported that his grandfather asked"
"48","Abu Hurayra said"
"49","Abu Ayyub al-Ansari told him that a bedouin came to the Prophet"
"50","Abu Hurayra reported that the Messenger of Allah"
"51","'Give your relatives\ntheir due"
"52","Abu Hurayra said"
"53","'Abdu'r-Rahman ibn 'Awf heard the Messenger of Allah"
"54","Abu'l-'Anbas said"
"55","'A'isha reported that the Prophet"
"56","Anas ibn Malik reported that the Messenger of Allah"
"57","Abu Hurayra heard that the Messenger of Allah"
"58","Ibn 'Umar said"
"59","Ibn 'Umar said"
"60","It is reported that al-Miqdam ibn Ma'dikarib heard the Messenger of Allah"
"61","Abu Ayyub Sulayman"
"62","Ibn 'Umar said"
"63","'Abdullah ibn 'Awfa reported that the Prophet"
"64","Jubayr ibn Mu'tim reported that he heard the Messenger of Allah"
"65","Abu Hurayra reported that the Messenger of Allah"
"66","Sa'id ibn Sam'an heard Abu Hurayra seeking refuge from the power of children\nand fools. Sa'id said"
"67","Abu Bakra reported that the Messenger of Allah"
"68","'Abdullah ibn 'Amr reported that the Prophet"
"69","Al-Bara' said"
"70","Hakim ibn Hizam said to the Prophet"
"71","Ibn 'Umar said"
"72","Jubayr ibn Mut'im said that he heard 'Umar ibn al-Khattab say on the\nminbar"
"73","Ibn 'Abbas said"
